  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></msup></math> tail and <math><msup><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math> tail occur at <math><msup><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math> tosses respectively implies that there is one tail in first three tosses, <math><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></msup></math> tail at <math><msup><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math> toss, one tail at next five tosses and&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math> tail at <math><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math> toss.<br /><br />So, the required probability <math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts> <mi>C</mi> <mprescripts></mprescripts> <mo>&nbsp;</mo> <mn>3</mn> </mmultiscripts> <msub> <mrow></mrow> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mfenced> <mrow> <mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>3</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced><msup> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <mfrac> <mn>2</mn> <mn>3</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced></mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>×</mo><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>3</mn> </mfrac> <mo>×</mo><mmultiscripts> <mi>C</mi> <mprescripts></mprescripts> <mo>&nbsp;</mo> <mn>5</mn> </mmultiscripts> <msub> <mrow></mrow> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>3</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced></mrow> <mn>1</mn> </msup> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <mfrac> <mn>2</mn> <mn>3</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced></mrow> <mn>4</mn> </msup> <mo>×</mo><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>3</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>320</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math>",
